     "<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Dear All,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">I want to apply the generalized partial credit\r\nmodel to TIMSS data. While running the following codes in the &quot;mirt&quot;\r\npackage, some errors appeared:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">&gt;\r\ndata&lt;-read.csv(&quot;Fin-Dim.csv&quot;,header=TRUE)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">&gt; library(mirt)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">&gt; data3&lt;-data [,10:300]</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">&gt; fit1 &lt;- mirt(data3,  model = 1,\r\nitemtype = &quot;gpcm&quot;,  verbose = FALSE)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:red\">Error in min(s, na.rm = TRUE):max(x, na.rm = TRUE)\r\n: </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:red\">  result would be too long a vector</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:red\">In addition: Warning messages:</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:red\">1: In min(s, na.rm = TRUE) :</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:red\">  no non-missing arguments to min; returning\r\nInf</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:red\">2: In max(x, na.rm = TRUE) :</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:red\">  no non-missing arguments to max; returning\r\n-Inf</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">I have to note that there are many missing\r\nvalues in the data, and some items of the test are partial credit. 0 shows\r\nwrong answer, 1 correct answer, and 2 partially correct.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">I would greatly appreciate\r\nany assistance or advice you could offer me. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Thank you for your time.\r\nI look forward to hearing from you.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Best,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Farshad</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"> </p>"
